{"id":"word:hebrew:H974","type":"word","title":"בָּחַן","subtitle":"H974 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to test (especially metals); generally and figuratively, to investigate","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בָּחַן (H974) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 29 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בָּחַן (bâchan) means to test (especially metals); generally and figuratively, to investigate First listed occurrence: 1Chr 29 17."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בָּחַן","transliteration":"bâchan","pronunciation":"baw-khan'","strong":"H974","lemmaId":"hebrew:H974","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["בֹּחֵ֣ן","תִּבְחָ֑ן","בֹ֔חַן","תִּבָּחֵ֑נוּ","וְ/יִבָּֽחֲנוּ֙"],"morphs":[["HVqrmsa",4],["HC/Vqq2ms",2],["HC/Vqq1cs/Sp3mp",2],["HVqi3fs",2],["HC/Vqrmsa",2],["HVqv2ms/Sp1cs",2],["HVPp3ms",1],["HVNi2mp",1],["HC/VNi3mp",1],["HVqi2ms/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to test (especially metals); generally and figuratively, to investigate","usage":"examine, prove, tempt, try (trial).","full":"H974. bachan [ בָּחַן ] verb examine, try (compare Aramaic בְּחַן , Syriac , try, examine ; Arabic I. VIII. test , compare W SG 65 ) — Qal Perfect suffix בְּחָנַ֫נִי Job 23:10 , בָּחַנְתָּ Psa 17:3 7 t.; Imperfect יִבְחָ֑ן 11:5 5 t.; Imperative suffix בְּחָנֵנִי 26:2 2 t.; Infinitive בְּחֹן Zech 13:9 ; Participle בֹּחֵן Jer 11:20 5 t. (|| נסה צרף, ); — 1 examine, scrutinize, try Psa 11:5 ; 139:23 ; Job 7:18 ; אָדָם בְנֵי יִבְחֲנוּ עַפְעַמָּיו His eyelids try the children of men (search them through and through) Psa 11:4 . 2 prove, test, try . a. with the metaphor of gold Job 23:10 ; אֶתהַֿזָּהָב כִּבְחֹן וּבְחַנְתִּים and I will try them as one tries gold Zech 13:9 . b. without metaphor, of God testing persons Psalm Zech 26:2; Zech 66:10; Zech 81:8; Jer 9:6 ; their ways 6:27 ; the לֵב Psa 17:3 ; Jer 12:3 ; Prov 17:3 ; 1Chr 29:17 ; reins Jer 17:10 ; heart and reins Psa 7:10 ; Jer 11:20 (= 20:12 ). c. of man testing or tempting God Psalm Jer 95:9; Mal 3:10 , 15 . d. the ear trying words Job 12:11 = 34:3 . Niph`al Imperfect יִבָּחֵן Job 34:36 ; Gen 42:15-16 , to be tried, proved . Pu`al בֹּחַן Ezek 21:18 the trial has been made ( ᵑ9 ᵑ6 ᵐ5 Ges MV Ew Ke, but noun ᵑ0 בֹּ֫חַן Symm HaEv.; read בְּחֵן with grace, favour , Hi Co).","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 29 17","keyReferences":["1Chr 29 17","Ezek 21 18","Gen 42 15","Gen 42 16","Jer 6 27","Jer 9 6","Jer 11 20","Jer 12 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":29,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 29 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֹּחֵ֣ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 21 18","book":"Ezek","chapter":21,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֹ֔חַן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVPp3ms"},{"reference":"Gen 42 15","book":"Gen","chapter":42,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תִּבָּחֵ֑נוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVNi2mp"},{"reference":"Gen 42 16","book":"Gen","chapter":42,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/יִבָּֽחֲנוּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/VNi3mp"},{"reference":"Jer 6 27","book":"Jer","chapter":6,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בָחַנְתָּ֖","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqq2ms"},{"reference":"Jer 9 6","book":"Jer","chapter":9,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בְחַנְתִּ֑י/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqq1cs/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Jer 11 20","book":"Jer","chapter":11,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֹּחֵ֥ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"Jer 12 3","book":"Jer","chapter":12,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בָחַנְתָּ֥","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqq2ms"},{"reference":"Jer 17 10","book":"Jer","chapter":17,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֹּחֵ֣ן